{"vfdDagargya": [{"id": "vfdDagArgya", "headword": "वृद्धगार्ग्य", "headword_slp1": "vfdDagArgya", "fold": "vfdDagargya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-encyclopedia", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृद्धगार्ग्य\n\nVṚDDHAGĀRGYA . An ancient hermit. Mention is made in mahābhārata, anuśāsana parva, Chapter 125, Stanza 77, that this hermit had conversed with the Manes about offerings made to them.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["vRRiddhagaargya", "vRddhagaargya", "vRiddhagaargya", "vRuddhagaargya", "vṛddhagārgya", "వృద్ధగార్గ్య", "ವೃದ್ಧಗಾರ್ಗ್ಯ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vRRiddhagaargya", "vRddhagaargya", "vRiddhagaargya", "vRuddhagaargya", "vṛddhagārgya", "వృద్ధగార్గ్య", "ವೃದ್ಧಗಾರ್ಗ್ಯ"]}], "vfdDakanya": [{"id": "vfdDakanyA", "headword": "वृद्धकन्या", "headword_slp1": "vfdDakanyA", "fold": "vfdDakanya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-encyclopedia", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृद्धकन्या\n\nVṚDDHAKANYĀ . Daughter of the hermit named kuṇigarga. (For further details see under kuṇigarga).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["vRRiddhakanyaa", "vRddhakanyaa", "vRiddhakanyaa", "vRuddhakanyaa", "vṛddhakanyā", "వృద్ధకన్యా", "ವೃದ್ಧಕನ್ಯಾ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vRRiddhakanyaa", "vRddhakanyaa", "vRiddhakanyaa", "vRuddhakanyaa", "vṛddhakanyā", "వృద్ధకన్యా", "ವೃದ್ಧಕನ್ಯಾ"]}], "vfdDaksatra_१": [{"id": "vfdDakzatra_१", "headword": "वृद्धक्षत्र_१", "headword_slp1": "vfdDakzatra_१", "fold": "vfdDaksatra_१", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-encyclopedia", "senses": [{"gloss": "वृद्धक्षत्र १\n\nVṚDDHAKṢATRA I . The father of jayadratha, the king of sindhu. (See under jayadratha I).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["vRRiddhakShatra", "vRRiddhakShatra_1", "vRddhakShatra", "vRddhakShatra_1", "vRddhaxatra", "vRddhaxatra_1", "vRiddhakShatra", "vRiddhakShatra_1", "vRuddhakShatra", "vRuddhakShatra_1", "vṛddhakṣatra", "vṛddhakṣatra_1", "वृद्धक्षत्र", "వృద్ధక్షత్ర", "వృద్ధక్షత్ర_౧", "ವೃದ್ಧಕ್ಷತ್ರ", "ವೃದ್ಧಕ್ಷತ್ರ_೧"], "synonyms_slp1": ["vRRiddhakShatra", "vRRidd